<title>NEW ZEALAND: Oakmark passes 5.0 pct in NZ's Fernz.</title>
<headline>Oakmark passes 5.0 pct in NZ's Fernz.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mutual fund The Oakmark International Fund, said in a statement to the New Zealand stock exchange on Wednesday that its stake in specialty chemicals group Fernz Corp had risen over 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>The fund said that it believed its most recent share purchase in Fernz had given it a stake of 5.04 pecent, above the level at which it is obliged to declare a significant interest.</p>
<p>The fund said all its purchases of Fernz shares were for investment purposes only. Last month a senior fund managers said Oakmark was focused on Australia among other areas at present.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
